WEBVTT

00:37:27.332 --> 00:37:30.226
She was in prison a number of times.

00:37:30.250 --> 00:37:32.507
She was in mental hospitals
a number of times.

00:37:32.531 --> 00:37:37.553
And then, in 1998, she got clean,

00:37:37.577 --> 00:37:39.697
and she was clean for 20 years.

00:37:39.721 --> 00:37:45.218
And she carried with her
this extraordinary capacity

00:37:45.242 --> 00:37:48.067
to meet people as exactly who they were,

00:37:48.091 --> 00:37:49.913
because of what she had been through.

00:37:49.937 --> 00:37:52.863
And because she had really, literally,
for quite a long time,

00:37:52.887 --> 00:37:55.779
been the worst person in the world,

00:37:55.803 --> 00:37:57.823
she never judged anybody.

00:37:57.847 --> 00:38:00.642
I'm such a perfectionist,
and I'm such a Goody Two-shoes,